Changes the state of the FitState.Handle
Rec: PUBLIC TYPE = RECORD [
traj: TrajHandle,
slist: SListHandle,
closed: BOOLEAN,
minDist: REAL,	--affects AddSample.  Won't add a new sample inside of this distance
otherContours: LIST OF Contour
];


